/E (The growth analysis is structured to separate \(i\) quarterly dynamics around the invasion period, \(ii\) the composition of the post-invasion level shift, and \(iii\) cumulative performance relative to a common baseline. The three figures are complementary; the first highlights timing and volatility, the second identifies which expenditure components account for the post-invasion change in activity levels, and the third summarizes the net effect in an index that is comparable across economies.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
