229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (The post-2023 pattern is therefore better characterized as an adjustment phase; the external position stabilizes as Russia-linked trade shrinks, while the underlying sensitivity of the balance to energy and broader import-export conditions remains present. The weakening from late 2024 onward, despite the diminished Russia component, reinforces this interpretation; the Russia shock did not create the external vulnerability but rather exposed it, after which the balance continued to be shaped primarily by trade dynamics with non-Russian partners. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
endobj
