/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (A note on figure convention: all Figures, except Figures 4, 5, and 6, contain a dashed vertical line indicating the start of the invasion. Moreover, Figures 1, 3, and 5 have been rebased to January 2022 = 100. Finally, most Figures had their datasets restricted to January 2019 to the present; an important exception is Figure 4.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K []
>>
